# Text files are stored and checked out with LF, matching .prettierrc's
# "endOfLine": "lf". Without this, core.autocrlf=true on Windows checks files
# out as CRLF and `prettier --check` reports every one of them.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.pdf binary
